{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/19337","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/19337/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/19337/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/19337/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/19337","id":259873047,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNTk4NzMwNDc=","number":19337,"title":"Allow to generate code for files outside of `rootDir` (e.g. in node_modules)","user":{"login":"tbosch","id":690815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDgxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/690815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch","html_url":"https://github.com/tbosch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null},{"id":375501288,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzU1MDEyODg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/area:%20core","name":"area: core","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":"Issues related to the framework runtime"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2017-09-22T16:42:58Z","updated_at":"2019-09-12T19:22:28Z","closed_at":"2017-10-31T15:51:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"With current ng5 we don't generate code for libraries outside of `rootDir`.\r\n\r\nWe should implement this properly (e.g. so that this also work in watch mode, ...).\r\n\r\nAlgorithm for mapping path to rootDir:\r\n- take common prefix from path and rootDir\r\n- count all `..`\r\n- produce path `rootDir/dotDotCount/suffix`\r\n\r\nIt is important that the generated path can be mapped back to the original file without extra caches, ... as TS might ask for generated files directly when passing an oldProgram, without looking at the base file first.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"tbosch","id":690815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDgxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/690815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch","html_url":"https://github.com/tbosch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbosch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/19337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1